    Larson et al. (2019), arXiv:1909.02027.

bert/ does not include coastalcph/lex-glue code; it clones and patches that
repository at image build time, and its license applies to that code.

Benchmark datasets are downloaded at run time from their sources and are not
redistributed here; results files under analysis/ are summary statistics.
